SUMMARY:Glen Ridge Arts & Eco Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us on May 16th\, 2026 to celebrate arts and the environment at the biggest festival of the year in Glen Ridge! \nThe day showcases the artistry of students and crafters\, local businesses\, live performances\, native plant sales\, an EV car show\, a clothing swap\, food and so much more! \nThe Arts & Eco Fair runs along Ridgewood Avenue in the heart of historic Glen Ridge\, NJ from 10 am – 4 pm. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
