SUMMARY:39th Annual Rose Squared Art Show Verona Park
DESCRIPTION:Rose Squared Art Shows presents more than 90 artisans at Verona Park May 16-17\, 2026. This event showcases both fine art and fine craft with works in apothecary\, artisanal foods\, ceramics\, jewelry\, wood\, digital art\, decorative and wearable fiber\, furniture\, glass\, painting\, 2D/3D mixed media and photography.\nShow hours 10-5 Saturday and Sunday Rain or Shine.\nVerona Park boasts more than 54 acres and is the fifth largest park in the Essex County Department of Parks\, our Rose Squared partner. Featuring a beautiful lake\, this easily accessible park (off Bloomfield Avenue) is an enchanting setting and has a fantastic layout for strolling through the art show while shopping and engaging with artists.\n475 Bloomfield Ave\, Verona\, NJ 07044. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
