SUMMARY:Restore The Feeling: Montclair Football Alumni & Community Fundraiser at Just Jake’s
DESCRIPTION:The Montclair football community is coming together once again. \nJoin for an afternoon of food\, music\, community\, and Mountie pride at Just Jake’s in Montclair. This special fundraiser will bring together Montclair Football alumni\, current student-athletes\, families\, supporters\, and community members to celebrate the tradition and future of Mountclair Football. \nThe event will include:\n• Music & community networking\n• 50/50 raffle\n• Alumni gathering\n• Fundraising to support Montclair Football student-athletes and program initiatives \nSuggested donation at the door: $25 \nWhether you’re an alumni\, parent\, player\, or longtime supporter\, come help us continue to Restore The Feeling. \nDate:\nMay 16\, 2026 \nTime:\n2:00 PM – 5:00 PM \nLocation:\nJust Jake’s\n30 Park Street\nMontclair\, NJ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
